# Godot extracts every texture embedded in a GLB into a sibling file on
# import (env_tree_prairie_01_bark_brown_01_diff_512.jpg, ...). They are
# regenerated from the .glb on any clean import, and there is one copy per
# variant, so committing them would add ~2 MB of duplicates that drift out of
# sync with the source GLB.
#
# The root .gitignore already covers *.import; it does not cover these,
# because until tree_pack v2 (2026-07-30) no bespoke pack shipped embedded
# textures. Scoped here rather than in the root file so it cannot collide
# with the vegetation-migration work in flight on the other packs.
*_bark_brown_01_diff_512.jpg
*_bark_brown_01_nor_512.jpg
*_leaf_green_512.png
*_leaf_gold_512.png
